---
layout: default
---
{% comment %}
Private client photo delivery — reusable for any future client (add one
_clients/*.md file per delivery, see README note there). Not in site.pages
(it lives in the `clients` collection, _config.yml), so it never appears in
the navbar; each document's own front matter also sets excluded/sitemap/
noindex to keep it out of site search, sitemap.xml, and search engines.
Share the page's URL directly with the client instead.

page.session_date and page.location are both optional, plain strings
(e.g. "October 10, 2026" and "Lacey Park, San Marino, California") — shown
together as one line under the subtitle when either is set.

Preview images live in page.gallery_path — small, web-sized, committed to
the repo so the page loads fast. The full-resolution originals are hosted
outside the repo (a GitHub Release asset, or wherever else), so one
delivery never bloats the site's git history: page.zip_url for a single
zip, or page.zip_parts (a list of {url, label}) when the batch is too big
for one file — GitHub Release assets cap out at 2GB each.
{% endcomment %}
<div class="call-out call-out_solid">
    <h1 class="call-out_title">{{ page.title }}</h1>
</div>

<section class="client-delivery">
  {% if page.subtitle %}
  <p class="client-delivery__subtitle">{{ page.subtitle }}</p>
  {% endif %}

  {% if page.session_date or page.location %}
  <p class="client-delivery__session-meta">
    {{ page.session_date }}{% if page.session_date and page.location %} &middot; {% endif %}{{ page.location }}
  </p>
  {% endif %}

  {% if page.note %}
  <div class="client-delivery__note">
    {% for p in page.note %}<p>{{ p }}</p>{% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% if page.zip_url %}
  <div class="client-delivery__download">
    <a class="button client-delivery__download-cta" href="{{ page.zip_url }}">
      Download All Photos{% if page.photo_count %} ({{ page.photo_count }}){% endif %}
    </a>
    {% if page.zip_size %}<p class="client-delivery__download-meta">ZIP file &middot; {{ page.zip_size }}</p>{% endif %}
  </div>
  {% elsif page.zip_parts %}
  <div class="client-delivery__download">
    <div class="client-delivery__download-group">
      {% for part in page.zip_parts %}
      <a class="button client-delivery__download-cta" href="{{ part.url }}">{{ part.label | default: "Download" }}</a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% if page.zip_size %}<p class="client-delivery__download-meta">ZIP files &middot; {{ page.zip_size }} total</p>{% endif %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="kppr-photo-grid">
    {% include gallery.html gallery_path=page.gallery_path %}
  </div>
</section>
